WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:08.000
we hear the words
natural and synthetic

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.530
all the time when talking about food,
medicine, clothes

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:15.559
and other things. but what do they mean?
if you took a poll

00:00:15.559 --> 00:00:19.480
most people would tell you that natural
has to do with their juice cleanse

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:22.529
organic groceries, yoga and other healthy activities

00:00:22.529 --> 00:00:26.090
but for synthetic they'll warn you of toxins

00:00:26.090 --> 00:00:30.029
scary chemicals and mean confusing
chemistry teachers

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:34.550
with all these charged emotions it's not
surprising that a lot of people equate

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:39.170
these words with good and bad. but this discounts

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:43.040
everything chemistry has to offer
society, so we need to change this view

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:47.520
natural simply means made by nature, the
same benevolent force that brings us

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:49.690
deadly viruses and toxic blowfish

00:00:49.690 --> 00:00:53.020
which looks strangely similar. synthetic means

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:56.410
made by humans who save lives with
antibiotics

00:00:56.410 --> 00:01:00.340
and synthetic microbes that eat up the
oil from a tanker spill. now that we've

00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:02.629
decoupled these words from good and bad

00:01:02.629 --> 00:01:06.030
let's look at something both nature and humans

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:09.979
make. a vitamin is something we must
consume in small amounts

00:01:09.979 --> 00:01:13.720
in order for our cells to keep normal
function and metabolism

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:18.060
most plants and animals make these on
their own but somewhere along biological

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:18.840
evolution

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:21.900
a few mammals lost the ability so we
have to eat them

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:25.830
take vitamin C. for thousands of years
we've gotten this from fruit

00:01:25.830 --> 00:01:30.030
but with modern science we can identify
the structure of this and other

00:01:30.030 --> 00:01:30.890
compounds

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:33.930
and make them ourselves. the question is

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:36.930
are they the same? to answer that

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:40.710
let's look at how a vitamin works. a
vitamin has just the right shape to fit

00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:41.610
into an

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:46.439
active site of an enzyme and make
interactions that turn on the enzyme

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:50.750
like a lock and key. and just as it
doesn't matter who makes your key

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:54.860
as long as it's the right shape for the
lock, same goes for the vitamin

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:58.360
that's why any molecule that these
specific atoms

00:01:58.360 --> 00:02:01.540
arranged in this way is vitamin C

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:05.579
nature makes this just fine, always has
but when nature does chemistry

00:02:05.579 --> 00:02:10.160
it is limited to the normal pH and
temperature inside a living organism

00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:13.090
so it has to use big bulky molecules

00:02:13.090 --> 00:02:16.380
to do blind chemistry. when we do
chemistry

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:21.560
we can use any exotic compounds and
conditions we want to build

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:25.110
any molecule we want, and even though the pathways

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:29.420
are different the end product is the
exact same

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:34.130
molecule. so the bioactivity of a
molecule can not depend on how it came

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:34.820
to be

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:38.590
an enzyme simply can't tell the
difference. furthermore

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:43.310
it is often cheaper and easier to
synthesize these in mass quantities

00:02:43.310 --> 00:02:47.000
than to have to extract and purify from
natural sources

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:50.600
so if we want to keep the growing global population

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:54.420
healthy and well-fed, we have to get over
the idea

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:57.930
that science looks like this, because
science

00:02:57.930 --> 00:02:59.100
looks like this

